    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Lands is an addictive real-time strategy game where you conquer islands, defeat enemies with your armies and use upgrades to claim victory in each level and become the master of the seas, accompanied by an epic orchestral soundtrack and beautiful 2D art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of the game is incremental, so you can use skill points you earn by defeating each boss to get upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get achievements, skins for transports and discover all the content the game has to offer. Will you be able to find the secret levels? And get the cheat achievements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 80 game levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 4 level maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Hidden secret levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 20 game upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 +200 unlockable achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 24 island types of different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 8 types of transportation: 4 ships and 4 aircrafts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 10 unlockable skins for each transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 3 types of wandering transports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 3 types of obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Original orchestral music</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/21e6d13f450e78fd2129b28d42de01da.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Lands is an addictive real-time strategy game where you conquer islands, defeat enemies with your armies and use upgrades to claim victory in each level and become the master of the seas, accompanied by an epic orchestral soundtrack and beautiful 2D art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/8728449bc161f7910477a9add201646b.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of the game is incremental, so you can use skill points you earn by defeating each boss to get upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/62474e3645314abee708d462c3d88159.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get achievements, skins for transports and discover all the content the game has to offer. Will you be able to find the secret levels? And get the cheat achievements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.poster.avif?t=1752958152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.webm?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481450/extras/54c1652d72fac6954758b491b0e378a5.mp4?t=1752958152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 80 game levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 4 level maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Hidden secret levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 20 game upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 +200 unlockable achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 24 island types of different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 8 types of transportation: 4 ships and 4 aircrafts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 10 unlockable skins for each transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 3 types of wandering transports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 3 types of obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Original orchestral music</p>",
